CASE 2: same fixture with acquired-header census entry
{
  "actual_error": "NORMAL_EVENT_ACQUIRED_SUPPLEMENT_NOT_IMPLEMENTED:0001048286-25-000011",
  "category": "IMPLEMENTATION_GAP",
  "callback_invocations": 0
}
COUNTEREXAMPLE CONFIRMED: the pre-callback overlap guard skips the older block at the cross-year gap day. A full-body validator cannot read or correct a block the walk never selects. The acquired census converts the missing event into an explicit implementation gap when its header is in that census; it does not recover the needed block.
